\title{Optimizer geometry in training interventions}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{optimization}
\tag{intervention}

\p{Equivalent parameterizations need not follow equivalent training
trajectories. Their evolution also depends on the update geometry; the scalar
loss and represented starting object do not always suffice.}

